@startuml
title Queues - Fluxos

actor Client
participant "QueueController" as C
participant "QueueService" as S
database "Postgres" as DB

== Criar fila em um balcão ==
Client -> C: POST /desks/{deskId}/queues {code, name}
C -> S: createQueue(deskId, cmd)
S -> DB: SELECT service_desk exists?
DB --> S: ok|null
alt desk não existe
  S --> C: NotFound
  C --> Client: 404
else
  S -> DB: INSERT queue (unique deskId+code)
  alt violação unique
    S --> C: Conflict
    C --> Client: 409
  else
    DB --> S: created
    S --> C: queue DTO
    C --> Client: 201
  end
end

== Listar filas por balcão ==
Client -> C: GET /desks/{deskId}/queues
C -> S: listByDesk(deskId)
S -> DB: SELECT queues by deskId
DB --> S: list
S --> C: list
C --> Client: 200
@enduml